@baseUrl = http://localhost:5220

### 10 meters to feet
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/convert?value=10&from=m&to=ft

### 100 °C to °F
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/convert?value=100&from=celsius&to=fahrenheit

### 5 kg to pounds
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/convert?value=5&from=kg&to=lb

### Error: incompatible units
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/convert?value=1&from=m&to=kg

### List all units
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/units

### List temperature units
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/units?category=temperature
